@debate_rights_health
title: Same-sex families and a COVID vaccine
subtitle: A loaded culture-war premise followed by a hypothetical health question.
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
view-if: pres_debate_rights_done = 0

The fourth and fifth questions collapse partnerships, marriage and adoption
into one test, then ask whether a future vaccine should be compulsory. Bosak
uses his clocks to turn both into warnings about coercion. His premise is still
hanging in the studio when the microphone reaches the Left.

- @debate_rights_full
- @debate_rights_dignity
- @debate_rights_cautious

@debate_rights_full
