@endorsement
title: The Left's endorsement
new-page: true

The default democratic option is **[+ pres_runoff_support_name +]**. An
endorsement changes only the transfer probability of Left voters.

- @endorse_accord
- @endorse_immediate
- @endorse_free
- @endorse_duda_deal

@endorse_accord
title: Trade the endorsement for a written social and constitutional accord
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Requires a democratic finalist willing to bargain.
choose-if: resources >= 2 and pres_runoff_target_relation >= 35 and pres_runoff_support_key != "duda" and pres_runoff_support_key != "bosak"
unavailable-subtitle: The target will not pay this policy price, or the Left cannot finance joint mobilisation.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; pres_runoff_endorsement = "Negotiated social-constitutional accord"; pres_runoff_target_bonus += 0.30; pres_runoff_preparation += 0.55; party_unity += 2; labor_credibility += 2; progressive_credibility += 2; ko_relation += 4 if pres_runoff_support_key = "trzaskowski"; p2050_relation += 4 if pres_runoff_support_key = "holownia"; psl_relation += 4 if pres_runoff_support_key = "kosiniak"; news_headline = "The Left prices its runoff endorsement"
go-to: support_market

@endorse_immediate
title: Endorse the democratic finalist without conditions
subtitle: Better voter compliance; no enforceable programme.
choose-if: pres_runoff_support_key != "bosak"
unavailable-subtitle: The leadership will not present a radical-right endorsement as democratic unity.
on-arrival: {!
Q.pres_runoff_endorsement = "Immediate lesser-evil endorsement";
Q.pres_runoff_target_bonus += 0.12;
Q.pres_runoff_preparation += 0.18;
Q.public_trust += 1;
Q.razem_dissent += 4;
if (Q.pres_runoff_support_key == "trzaskowski") Q.ko_relation += 4;
if (Q.pres_runoff_support_key == "holownia") Q.p2050_relation += 4;
if (Q.pres_runoff_support_key == "kosiniak") Q.psl_relation += 4;
Q.news_headline = "The Left endorses " + Q.pres_runoff_support_name;
!}
go-to: support_market

@endorse_free
title: Release Left voters without an endorsement
subtitle: Preserves autonomy; depresses transfer and angers the democratic camp.
on-arrival: pres_runoff_endorsement = "Free vote"; ko_relation -= 8 if pres_runoff_support_key = "trzaskowski"; p2050_relation -= 5 if pres_runoff_support_key = "holownia"; party_unity -= 2; progressives_dissent += 5; spring_dissent += 5; razem_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "The Left refuses to command its runoff voters"
go-to: support_market

@endorse_duda_deal
title: Offer Duda a welfare and institutional non-aggression pact
subtitle: Palace path: a large internal rupture for a narrow written price.
view-if: pres_finalist_a_key = "duda" or pres_finalist_b_key = "duda"
choose-if: president_relation >= 30 or presidential_channel_open = 1 or pis_relation >= 20
unavailable-subtitle: The Palace has no trusted channel to the Left.
on-arrival: pres_runoff_support_key = "duda"; pres_runoff_support_name = "Andrzej Duda"; pres_runoff_endorsement = "Palace welfare deal"; pres_runoff_target_bonus += 0.16; president_relation += 10; pis_relation += 4; ko_relation -= 14; razem_dissent += 15; progressives_dissent += 12; spring_dissent += 10; barons_dissent -= 5; party_unity -= 8; news_headline = "A Left–Palace runoff pact shocks both camps"
go-to: support_market

@support_market
title: Inter-round support market
new-page: true

= Two negotiations — [+ pres_support_actions_remaining +] remain

The Left can broker, mobilise or persuade. Every deal changes one eliminated
electorate or creates new turnout; it does not transfer an entire party.

- @support_holownia
- @support_psl
- @support_ko
- @support_movements
- @support_bosak
- @support_turnout
- @support_release

@support_holownia
title: Offer Hołownia an oversight and public-service accord
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Better with an existing Poland 2050 relationship.
view-if: pres_support_holownia = 0 and pres_finalist_a_key != "holownia" and pres_finalist_b_key != "holownia"
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: No shared operation can be staffed.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.pres_support_holownia = 1;
Q.pres_support_actions_remaining -= 1;
Q.pres_trade_holownia_boost =
    0.055 + (Q.p2050_relation >= 35 ? 0.035 : 0);
Q.p2050_relation += 4;
Q.pres_runoff_target_bonus += 0.10;
Q.news_headline =
    "Hołownia's camp offers conditional runoff cooperation";
!}
go-to: support_market if pres_support_actions_remaining > 0; runoff_poll if pres_support_actions_remaining <= 0

@support_psl
title: Give PSL a county-services and local-autonomy guarantee
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. A rural bridge with a conservative policy edge.
view-if: pres_support_psl = 0 and pres_finalist_a_key != "kosiniak" and pres_finalist_b_key != "kosiniak"
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: PSL will not trade on an unfunded promise.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.pres_support_psl = 1;
Q.pres_support_actions_remaining -= 1;
Q.pres_trade_psl_boost =
    0.06 + (Q.psl_relation >= 35 ? 0.035 : 0);
Q.psl_relation += 5;
Q.local_network += 2;
Q.rural_support += 2;
Q.progressives_dissent += 2;
Q.news_headline = "PSL prices its county networks";
!}
go-to: support_market if pres_support_actions_remaining > 0; runoff_poll if pres_support_actions_remaining <= 0

@support_ko
title: Exchange constitutional guarantees for KO's full field operation
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Available only when Trzaskowski is eliminated.
view-if: pres_support_ko = 0 and pres_finalist_a_key != "trzaskowski" and pres_finalist_b_key != "trzaskowski" and pres_runoff_support_key != "duda" and pres_runoff_support_key != "bosak"
choose-if: resources >= 2 and ko_relation >= 45
unavailable-subtitle: KO lacks trust in the target or the operation cannot be financed.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; pres_support_ko = 1; pres_support_actions_remaining -= 1; pres_trade_ko_boost = 0.11; ko_relation += 6; constitutional_restraint += 3; razem_dissent += 4; pres_runoff_target_bonus += 0.22; news_headline = "KO opens its municipal machine to the runoff target"
go-to: support_market if pres_support_actions_remaining > 0; runoff_poll if pres_support_actions_remaining <= 0

@support_movements
title: Activate union, feminist and tenant turnout committees
subtitle: No party transfer. Works only for a democratic or Left target.
view-if: pres_support_movements = 0
choose-if: pres_runoff_support_key != "duda" and pres_runoff_support_key != "bosak"
unavailable-subtitle: The movements refuse the selected endorsement.
on-arrival: pres_support_movements = 1; pres_support_actions_remaining -= 1; pres_trade_left_boost += 0.055; pres_runoff_target_bonus += 0.62; organiser_energy -= 4; turnout_readiness += 2; feminist_trust += 2; labor_credibility += 2; news_headline = "Independent movements build a runoff turnout operation"
go-to: support_market if pres_support_actions_remaining > 0; runoff_poll if pres_support_actions_remaining <= 0

@support_bosak
title: Contest Bosak's voters on wages, privacy and anti-duopoly anger
subtitle: No leadership endorsement; a risky appeal to an eliminated electorate.
view-if: pres_support_bosak = 0 and pres_finalist_a_key != "bosak" and pres_finalist_b_key != "bosak"
on-arrival: pres_support_bosak = 1; pres_support_actions_remaining -= 1; pres_trade_bosak_boost = 0.045; labor_credibility += 1; minority_safety -= 3; progressive_credibility -= 3; progressives_dissent += 4; news_headline = "The runoff campaign contests rather than endorses the radical-right electorate"
go-to: support_market if pres_support_actions_remaining > 0; runoff_poll if pres_support_actions_remaining <= 0

@support_turnout
title: Spend the negotiation on registration, rides and ballot protection
subtitle: Free fallback. Creates turnout instead of claiming another party.
view-if: pres_support_turnout = 0
on-arrival: pres_support_turnout = 1; pres_support_actions_remaining -= 1; pres_runoff_target_bonus += 0.38; pres_turnout_bonus += 0.7; turnout_readiness += 2; local_network += 1; news_headline = "The Left turns one bargaining slot into turnout"
go-to: support_market if pres_support_actions_remaining > 0; runoff_poll if pres_support_actions_remaining <= 0

@support_release
title: Keep one slot empty and let every organisation decide
subtitle: Guaranteed fallback. No transfer bonus; less factional ownership of the result.
view-if: pres_support_release = 0
on-arrival: pres_support_release = 1; pres_support_actions_remaining -= 1; party_unity += 1; movement_autonomy += 2; news_headline = "The Left closes one runoff negotiation without a deal"
go-to: support_market if pres_support_actions_remaining > 0; runoff_poll if pres_support_actions_remaining <= 0

@calculate_runoff
on-arrival: {!
const clampRunoff = function(value, low, high) {
    return Math.max(low, Math.min(high, Number(value) || 0));
};
const sources = [
    "duda", "trzaskowski", "holownia", "bosak",
    "kosiniak", "left", "other"
];
const positions = {
    left: -0.85,
    trzaskowski: -0.25,
    holownia: 0.05,
    other: 0.10,
    kosiniak: 0.25,
    duda: 0.72,
    bosak: 0.95
};
const sourceShares = {};
for (const source of sources) {
    sourceShares[source] =
        Math.max(0, Number(Q["pres_r1_raw_" + source]) || 0);
}
const a = Q.pres_finalist_a_key;
const b = Q.pres_finalist_b_key;
const target = Q.pres_runoff_support_key;
const commonDudaTrz =
    (a == "duda" && b == "trzaskowski") ||
    (a == "trzaskowski" && b == "duda");
const leftDuda =
    (a == "left" && b == "duda") ||
    (a == "duda" && b == "left");
const vectorFor = function(source) {
    if (source == a) return {a: 0.985, b: 0, abstain: 0.015};
    if (source == b) return {a: 0, b: 0.985, abstain: 0.015};
    const orient = function(firstKey, first, secondKey, second, abstain) {
        const vector = {a: 0, b: 0, abstain: abstain};
        if (a == firstKey) vector.a = first;
        if (b == firstKey) vector.b = first;
        if (a == secondKey) vector.a = second;
        if (b == secondKey) vector.b = second;
        return vector;
    };
    if (commonDudaTrz) {
        if (source == "holownia") {
            return orient("duda", 0.14, "trzaskowski", 0.76, 0.10);
        }
        if (source == "kosiniak") {
            return orient("duda", 0.24, "trzaskowski", 0.64, 0.12);
        }
        if (source == "bosak") {
            return orient("duda", 0.54, "trzaskowski", 0.27, 0.19);
        }
        if (source == "left") {
            return orient("duda", 0.04, "trzaskowski", 0.67, 0.29);
        }
        return orient("duda", 0.24, "trzaskowski", 0.45, 0.31);
    }
    if (leftDuda) {
        if (source == "holownia") {
            return orient("duda", 0.25, "left", 0.65, 0.10);
        }
        if (source == "kosiniak") {
            return orient("duda", 0.43, "left", 0.45, 0.12);
        }
        if (source == "bosak") {
            return orient("duda", 0.55, "left", 0.20, 0.25);
        }
        if (source == "trzaskowski") {
            return orient("duda", 0.07, "left", 0.83, 0.10);
        }
        return orient("duda", 0.25, "left", 0.50, 0.25);
    }
    const distanceA = Math.abs(positions[source] - positions[a]);
    const distanceB = Math.abs(positions[source] - positions[b]);
    const turnoutBySource = {
        duda: 0.985,
        trzaskowski: 0.94,
        holownia: 0.88,
        bosak: 0.78,
        kosiniak: 0.86,
        left: 0.84,
        other: 0.72
    };
    const active = turnoutBySource[source] || 0.8;
    const aPreference =
        1 / (1 + Math.exp((distanceA - distanceB) * 3.0));
    return {
        a: active * aPreference,
        b: active * (1 - aPreference),
        abstain: 1 - active
    };
};
const boostToward = function(vector, candidate, amount) {
    if (candidate != a && candidate != b) return vector;
    const targetField = candidate == a ? "a" : "b";
    const otherField = candidate == a ? "b" : "a";
    const room = Math.max(0, 1 - vector[targetField]);
    let shift = Math.min(Math.max(0, amount), room);
    let fromAbstain = Math.min(vector.abstain, shift * 0.70);
    vector.abstain -= fromAbstain;
    vector[targetField] += fromAbstain;
    shift -= fromAbstain;
    const fromOther = Math.min(vector[otherField], shift);
    vector[otherField] -= fromOther;
    vector[targetField] += fromOther;
    shift -= fromOther;
    if (shift > 0) {
        const lastAbstain = Math.min(vector.abstain, shift);
        vector.abstain -= lastAbstain;
        vector[targetField] += lastAbstain;
    }
    const total = vector.a + vector.b + vector.abstain;
    vector.abstain += 1 - total;
    return vector;
};

let rawA = 0;
let rawB = 0;
let abstentionRaw = 0;
for (const source of sources) {
    let vector = vectorFor(source);
    if (source == "left" && source != a && source != b) {
        if (commonDudaTrz) {
            const trzField = a == "trzaskowski" ? "a" : "b";
            const razemShare = clampRunoff(
                (Number(Q.razem_strength) || 20) / 100,
                0.05,
                0.45
            );
            let reluctance =
                0.045 + razemShare * 0.25 +
                Math.max(0, (Number(Q.razem_dissent) || 0) - 20) *
                    0.0015;
            if (Q.pres_runoff_endorsement ==
                "Negotiated social-constitutional accord") {
                reluctance *= 0.35;
            } else if (Q.pres_runoff_endorsement ==
                "Immediate lesser-evil endorsement") {
                reluctance *= 0.65;
            }
            reluctance -=
                Math.min(
                    0.025,
                    (Number(Q.pres_trade_left_boost) || 0) * 0.35
                );
            reluctance = clampRunoff(reluctance, 0.015, 0.14);
            const stranded = Math.min(vector[trzField], reluctance);
            vector[trzField] -= stranded;
            vector.abstain += stranded;
            Q.pres_razem_trzaskowski_reluctance =
                Math.round(stranded * 1000) / 10;
        }
        let endorsementBoost = 0;
        if (Q.pres_runoff_endorsement ==
            "Negotiated social-constitutional accord") {
            endorsementBoost = 0.16;
        } else if (Q.pres_runoff_endorsement ==
            "Immediate lesser-evil endorsement") {
            endorsementBoost = 0.09;
        } else if (Q.pres_runoff_endorsement ==
            "Palace welfare deal") {
            endorsementBoost = 0.30;
        }
        endorsementBoost += Number(Q.pres_trade_left_boost) || 0;
        vector = boostToward(vector, target, endorsementBoost);
    }
    if (source == "holownia" && source != a && source != b) {
        vector = boostToward(
            vector,
            target,
            Number(Q.pres_trade_holownia_boost) || 0
        );
    }
    if (source == "kosiniak" && source != a && source != b) {
        vector = boostToward(
            vector,
            target,
            Number(Q.pres_trade_psl_boost) || 0
        );
    }
    if (source == "trzaskowski" && source != a && source != b) {
        vector = boostToward(
            vector,
            target,
            Number(Q.pres_trade_ko_boost) || 0
        );
    }
    if (source == "bosak" && source != a && source != b) {
        vector = boostToward(
            vector,
            target,
            Number(Q.pres_trade_bosak_boost) || 0
        );
    }
    const sourceShare = sourceShares[source];
    rawA += sourceShare * vector.a;
    rawB += sourceShare * vector.b;
    abstentionRaw += sourceShare * vector.abstain;
    const targetShare = target == a ? vector.a :
        (target == b ? vector.b : 0);
    if (source == "left") {
        Q.pres_transfer_left_target =
            Math.round(targetShare * 1000) / 10;
    }
    if (source == "holownia") {
        Q.pres_transfer_holownia_target =
            Math.round(targetShare * 1000) / 10;
    }
    if (source == "kosiniak") {
        Q.pres_transfer_psl_target =
            Math.round(targetShare * 1000) / 10;
    }
    if (source == "trzaskowski") {
        Q.pres_transfer_ko_target =
            Math.round(targetShare * 1000) / 10;
    }
    if (source == "bosak") {
        Q.pres_transfer_bosak_target =
            Math.round(targetShare * 1000) / 10;
    }
    if (source == "other") {
        Q.pres_transfer_other_target =
            Math.round(targetShare * 1000) / 10;
    }
}
Q.pres_transfer_abstention =
    Math.round(abstentionRaw * 100) / 100;

const newTurnout = {
    duda: 1.10,
    trzaskowski: 1.10,
    holownia: 1.35,
    bosak: 0.90,
    kosiniak: 0.75,
    left: 1.60 + (Q.pres_ko_joint_candidate ? 1.40 : 0),
    other: 0
};
rawA += newTurnout[a] || 0;
rawB += newTurnout[b] || 0;
const targetBonus =
    (Number(Q.pres_runoff_target_bonus) || 0) +
    (Number(Q.pres_runoff_preparation) || 0) * 0.35;
if (target == a) rawA += targetBonus;
if (target == b) rawB += targetBonus;

const shock = Q.pres_runoff_calc_mode == "result"
    ? Number(Q.pres_runoff_result_shock) || 0
    : Number(Q.pres_runoff_poll_shock) || 0;
rawA = Math.max(0.1, rawA + shock);
rawB = Math.max(0.1, rawB - shock);
const validRaw = rawA + rawB;
const shareA = rawA * 100 / Math.max(0.1, validRaw);
const shareB = 100 - shareA;
const displayA = Math.round(shareA * 10) / 10;
const displayB = Math.round((100 - displayA) * 10) / 10;

if (Q.pres_runoff_calc_mode == "poll") {
    Q.pres_runoff_poll_a = displayA;
    Q.pres_runoff_poll_b = displayB;
}
if (Q.pres_runoff_calc_mode == "result") {
    const wasNewRunoff = !Q.pres_runoff_complete;
    Q.pres_runoff_raw_a = shareA;
    Q.pres_runoff_raw_b = shareB;
    Q.pres_runoff_display_a = displayA;
    Q.pres_runoff_display_b = displayB;
    const turnout = clampRunoff(
        68.18 +
            ((Number(Q.turnout_readiness) || 58) - 58) * 0.030 +
            (Number(Q.pres_turnout_bonus) || 0) * 0.12 -
            abstentionRaw * 0.018 +
            (Number(Q.pres_runoff_turnout_shock) || 0),
        58,
        76
    );
    Q.pres_runoff_turnout = Math.round(turnout * 100) / 100;
    Q.pres_runoff_valid_votes = Math.round(
        20458911 * turnout / 68.18
    );
    Q.pres_runoff_votes_a = Math.floor(
        Q.pres_runoff_valid_votes * shareA / 100
    );
    Q.pres_runoff_votes_b =
        Q.pres_runoff_valid_votes - Q.pres_runoff_votes_a;
    const formatVotes = function(value) {
        return String(Math.round(value)).replace(
            /\B(?=(\d{3})+(?!\d))/g,
            " "
        );
    };
    Q.pres_runoff_votes_a_display =
        formatVotes(Q.pres_runoff_votes_a);
    Q.pres_runoff_votes_b_display =
        formatVotes(Q.pres_runoff_votes_b);
    Q.pres_runoff_valid_votes_display =
        formatVotes(Q.pres_runoff_valid_votes);
    const winnerKey = shareA > shareB ? a : b;
    const winnerName = shareA > shareB
        ? Q.pres_finalist_a_name
        : Q.pres_finalist_b_name;
    Q.pres_runoff_winner_key = winnerKey;
    Q.pres_runoff_winner_name = winnerName;
    Q.pres_runoff_margin =
        Math.round(Math.abs(shareA - shareB) * 100) / 100;
    Q.pres_2020_president_elect_key = winnerKey;
    Q.pres_2020_president_elect_name = winnerName;
    Q.president_name = "Andrzej Duda";
    Q.trzaskowski_won = winnerKey == "trzaskowski" ? 1 : 0;
    Q.left_president = 0;
    if (wasNewRunoff) {
        if (winnerKey == "trzaskowski") {
            Q.president_relation = Math.max(
                Number(Q.president_relation) || 0,
                Q.pres_runoff_support_key == "trzaskowski" ? 58 : 48
            );
            Q.ko_relation += 5;
            Q.trz_inauguration_status =
                "President-elect — certification pending";
        } else if (winnerKey == "left") {
            Q.president_relation = 82;
            Q.party_unity += 8;
            Q.public_trust += 5;
        } else if (winnerKey == "duda") {
            Q.president_relation +=
                Q.pres_runoff_support_key == "duda" ? 8 : -4;
        } else {
            Q.president_relation = 45;
        }
    }
    Q.pres_runoff_complete = 1;
    Q.pres_2020_active = 0;
    Q.pres_2020_phase = winnerKey == "trzaskowski"
        ? "Certification pending"
        : (winnerKey == "duda" ? "Election complete" : "Oath pending");
    Q.news_headline = winnerName +
        " wins the presidency by " + Q.pres_runoff_margin + " points";
}
!}

@runoff_poll
title: The runoff tracking poll
new-page: true
on-arrival: pres_runoff_calc_mode = "poll"
call: poland_presidential_election.calculate_runoff

= The campaign between ballots

Poll margin: **±1.8 points**. First-round voters are not owned by the candidates
they supported. The finalists must keep their own coalitions while persuading
people whose preferred name is no longer on the ballot.

<div class="poll-table">
<div class="poll-row"><span><b>[+ pres_finalist_a_name +]</b></span><span>[+ pres_runoff_poll_a +]%</span><span>finalist A</span></div>
<div class="poll-row"><span><b>[+ pres_finalist_b_name +]</b></span><span>[+ pres_runoff_poll_b +]%</span><span>finalist B</span></div>
</div>

We are asking our voters to support **[+ pres_runoff_support_name +]** under
**[+ pres_runoff_endorsement +]**. [? if pres_finalist_a_key = "trzaskowski" or
pres_finalist_b_key = "trzaskowski": Razem organisers remain reluctant to
campaign for Trzaskowski; a leadership endorsement will not make every Left
voter follow.?] Hołownia's volunteers, PSL's local networks and Bosak's
anti-system electorate are making their own choices too.

- @final_push_safe
- @final_push_ground
- @final_push_gamble

@final_push_safe
title: Protect the agreements and make no final promise
subtitle: Small disciplined gain; lowest factional risk.
on-arrival: pres_runoff_target_bonus += 0.15; party_unity += 1; pres_runoff_calc_mode = "result"; news_headline = "The runoff closes on the negotiated coalition"
go-to: runoff_count

@final_push_ground
title: Put every remaining organiser on election-day turnout
subtitle: Stronger target mobilisation; organisers will be exhausted.
on-arrival: pres_runoff_target_bonus += 0.48; pres_turnout_bonus += 0.45; organiser_energy -= 5; turnout_readiness += 1; pres_runoff_calc_mode = "result"; news_headline = "The Left empties its offices into the runoff ground game"
go-to: runoff_count

@final_push_gamble
title: Release an aggressive final digital contrast
subtitle: High reach and greater backlash inside a fragile alliance.
on-arrival: pres_runoff_target_bonus += 0.62; media_capacity += 1; public_trust -= 1; party_unity -= 2; pres_runoff_calc_mode = "result"; news_headline = "A final contrast ad dominates the runoff silence"
go-to: runoff_count

@runoff_count
title: Presidential runoff count
new-page: true
call: poland_presidential_election.calculate_runoff

= [+ pres_runoff_winner_name +] elected President

Turnout: **[+ pres_runoff_turnout +]%**  
Valid votes: **[+ pres_runoff_valid_votes_display +]**

<div class="poll-table">
<div class="poll-row"><span><b>[+ pres_finalist_a_name +]</b></span><span>[+ pres_runoff_display_a +]%</span><span>[+ pres_runoff_votes_a_display +]</span></div>
<div class="poll-row"><span><b>[+ pres_finalist_b_name +]</b></span><span>[+ pres_runoff_display_b +]%</span><span>[+ pres_runoff_votes_b_display +]</span></div>
</div>

The margin is **[+ pres_runoff_margin +] points**. The result came from retained
first-round votes, partial transfers, abstention and new turnout—not from a
single endorsement switch.

- @runoff_consequences: Record the political consequences

@runoff_consequences
title: A presidency and a party system
new-page: true

[? if pres_runoff_winner_key = "duda": Duda remains in the Palace, but the
campaign has tested how far he can act as PiS's candidate and how far he can
build a mandate of his own.?]

[? if pres_runoff_winner_key = "trzaskowski": Poland enters cohabitation: a KO
candidate has won the count, but PiS still controls the institutions that must
certify the result, convene the National Assembly and hear the oath.?]

[? if pres_runoff_winner_key = "left": The almost impossible route has opened.
The Left holds the presidency without controlling the government, and every
faction now claims ownership of the victory.?]

[? if pres_runoff_winner_key = "holownia": Hołownia reaches the Palace before
building a party. His volunteer campaign becomes an immediate centrist pole.?]

[? if pres_runoff_winner_key = "kosiniak": PSL has achieved a national prize
far beyond its parliamentary size. Every coalition will pay for it.?]

[? if pres_runoff_winner_key = "bosak": A radical-right presidency breaks the
old democratic-camp arithmetic and accelerates the struggle inside
Konfederacja.?]

