@challenger_inauguration_2020
# prose-audit: Grade A — The scene cleanly distinguishes election from accession and sends any real office incompatibility to its named succession process.
title: The President-elect takes the oath
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.pres_generic_inauguration_done = 1;
Q.president_name = Q.pres_2020_president_elect_name ||
    Q.pres_runoff_winner_name;
Q.left_president =
    Q.pres_2020_president_elect_key == "left" ? 1 : 0;
Q.pres_2020_phase = "Presidency active";
Q.news_headline = Q.president_name +
    " takes office after the constitutional oath";
!}

= August 2020 — Election is not inauguration

Andrzej Duda remains President until the elected successor stands before the
National Assembly. With the oath, **[+ president_name +]** finally acquires the
veto, appointment and command powers voters awarded. Any parliamentary or
party office left behind must now pass to its lawful successor.

